'''
4. write a python program to create a simple password validation system.
The program should repeatedly ask the user to enter a password until a valid password is entered. A password will be considered valid only if it has at least 8 characters and contains the @ symbol.
Once the user enters a valid  password, the program should display "Password created" and stop'''

while True:
    pw = input("Enter a password: ")
    if len(pw) >= 8 and "@" in pw:
        print("Password Set Successfully!")
        break
    else:
        print("Weak Password.\nTry again.")
